+        // Set while a Lua mod is being torn down and restarted (auto-reload, Ctrl+R). That happens on
+        // another thread while the game thread keeps calling into Lua, and Lua is not thread-safe: two
+        // threads allocating in one lua_State corrupt the heap (STATUS_HEAP_CORRUPTION, no crash dump).
